1
00:02:11,260 --> 00:02:15,120
Jooheon: Damn it, you overgrown worm!

2
00:02:58,040 --> 00:03:01,920
Jooheon: N-No, not like this!

3
00:03:03,510 --> 00:03:06,240
Jooheon: Kwon, you damn old fool!
How could you do this to me?

4
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:11,040
Jooheon: How could you do this to me?!

5
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:29,210
sign: TOMB RAIDER KING

6
00:04:48,690 --> 00:04:52,060
Taejoon: This mission must succeed at all costs.

7
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:56,860
Taejoon: In return, 
I'll give you a reward worthy of it.

8
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:33,750
Jooheon: There's no way this is how I die!

9
00:05:43,710 --> 00:05:46,060
Jooheon: Jooheon Suh, 38 years old.

10
00:05:46,890 --> 00:05:48,490
Jooheon: Looks like today

11
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,550
Jooheon: is the day I die.

12
00:05:51,380 --> 00:05:53,820
Crow: Good grief, you're loud.

13
00:06:02,890 --> 00:06:05,350
Jooheon: What the hell …?

14
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:09,510
Crow: Oh? You can hear my voice?

15
00:06:16,150 --> 00:06:21,220
Jooheon: You're not my first talking relic.
Whichever god's trinket you are

16
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:25,710
Jooheon: get rid of this snake and let me go, 
while I'm still asking nicely.

17
00:06:30,210 --> 00:06:33,460
Crow: Do you truly think
you can survive in that body?

18
00:06:39,150 --> 00:06:41,890
Crow: You've been split clean in two.

19
00:06:41,890 --> 00:06:44,870
Crow: At this point, can you even feel pain?

20
00:06:45,860 --> 00:06:49,020
Crow: If I move the snake, will you just
walk out of this place?

21
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:52,380
Crow: Or do you plan to crawl?

22
00:06:53,060 --> 00:06:56,550
Crow: You're barely holding on to life
by the cheapest of tricks.

23
00:06:56,550 --> 00:06:59,220
Crow: How much longer do you think you have?

24
00:07:01,710 --> 00:07:06,060
Crow: An exceptional talent, 
born in the wrong era.

25
00:07:06,060 --> 00:07:11,060
Crow: Now you'll die without ever making proper
use of those little tricks of yours.

26
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:16,530
Jooheon: Shut up! You know nothing about me.

27
00:07:17,640 --> 00:07:18,980
Jooheon: Do you think

28
00:07:19,890 --> 00:07:23,960
Jooheon: I lived this way, because I wanted to?

29
00:07:24,710 --> 00:07:28,510
Jooheon: Taejoon Kwon, you bastard.

30
00:07:29,350 --> 00:07:35,060
Jooheon: I'll kill you, no matter what it takes!

31
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:41,440
Crow: Hahaha, how amusing.

32
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:44,960
Crow: Yes, it would be a waste
to let all that talent die here.

33
00:07:46,860 --> 00:07:49,240
Jooheon: W-What is that?

34
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:52,780
Jooheon: A crow?

35
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,690
Crow: I will grant you a chance.

36
00:07:59,690 --> 00:08:04,170
Crow: Go and try to claim
the throne of the true king.

37
00:08:20,380 --> 00:08:22,420
Jooheon: Become a king? What?

38
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:27,290
Jooheon: Why couldn't it be an eagle helping me?
A creepy crow of all things.

39
00:08:28,020 --> 00:08:31,330
Jooheon: Still, it seemed to be
at least a hero-grade.

40
00:08:31,330 --> 00:08:33,780
Jooheon: Maybe... even a god-grade relic?

41
00:08:32,350 --> 00:08:35,289
Jooheon: But it did look like a crow...

42
00:08:33,780 --> 00:08:35,929
Mother: You're just going to let him go?

43
00:08:35,289 --> 00:08:38,710
Mother: He hit my son!

44
00:08:35,929 --> 00:08:38,330
Jooheon: Wait. What's this?

45
00:08:38,950 --> 00:08:40,210
Jooheon: My... My legs!

46
00:08:39,500 --> 00:08:40,210
Mother: This is...

47
00:08:40,549 --> 00:08:42,929
Mother: Oh? Is he out of his mind?!

48
00:08:42,929 --> 00:08:47,210
Jooheon: They're fine.
And more importantly... I'm alive?!

49
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:49,490
Boy: What's up with that boomer?

50
00:08:49,490 --> 00:08:51,440
Boy: Ugh, this is so annoying.

51
00:08:53,090 --> 00:08:56,330
Mother: See?
There's clearly something up with him.

52
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,260
Mother: So do something!

53
00:08:57,130 --> 00:08:58,260
Jooheon: A police station?

54
00:08:58,260 --> 00:09:02,690
Policeman 1: Hey, hey. Stop muttering
and finish writing your statement.

55
00:09:02,690 --> 00:09:05,080
Policeman 1: I just want your ID.
What's taking you so long?

56
00:09:05,950 --> 00:09:08,240
Mother: I told you he's weird! Goodness.

57
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:11,780
Policeman 1: I don't have all night.

58
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:12,820
Jooheon: Ah... yes.

59
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:15,150
Mother: He looks perfectly normal, 
so what's wrong with him?

60
00:09:14,180 --> 00:09:15,600
Jooheon: Is this the crow's doing?

61
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,910
Policeman 1: Name?

62
00:09:16,130 --> 00:09:17,910
Jooheon: Is this a dream? A hallucination?

63
00:09:18,510 --> 00:09:20,090
Jooheon: No, it feels too real.

64
00:09:20,090 --> 00:09:23,260
Policeman 1: I'm asking for your name. Come on!

65
00:09:23,910 --> 00:09:26,090
Policeman 1: I also want to go home, okay?

66
00:09:26,090 --> 00:09:28,580
Policeman 2: Working overtime on
the first day of the year...

67
00:09:29,090 --> 00:09:31,580
Policeman 2: Be damned, 2025...

68
00:09:31,580 --> 00:09:33,600
Jooheon: What?

69
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:40,040
Jooheon: It's 2025?

70
00:09:42,310 --> 00:09:45,620
Jooheon: How is that possible?
Was I reborn?

71
00:09:45,620 --> 00:09:49,510
Jooheon: No, 2025 was 15 years ago.

72
00:09:49,510 --> 00:09:53,080
Jooheon: Did I... regress into the past? For real?

73
00:09:54,060 --> 00:09:57,930
Crow: Go and try to claim
the throne of the true king.

74
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:03,200
Mother: Hey, you!

75
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:06,060
Mother: Why do you refuse to answer?

76
00:10:06,060 --> 00:10:09,210
Mother: And what's with
the muttering and the stupid grin?

77
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:13,980
Jooheon: That lady... looks familiar.

78
00:10:18,750 --> 00:10:20,510
Jooheon: Now I remember.

79
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:25,530
Jooheon: That little punk picked a fight
with me first, so I shoved him.

80
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:26,180
Boy: Are you kidding me? Do you think
 I'm a pushover? You started this!

81
00:10:25,530 --> 00:10:29,490
Jooheon: Then he pretended to fall over
and dragged me to the police station.

82
00:10:26,180 --> 00:10:29,490
Boy: Damn, you're pissing me off.
Should I just gouge your eyes out?

83
00:10:29,490 --> 00:10:31,510
Boy: Got a problem? Then fight me!

84
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:34,660
Mother: You hit my son!
He's a senior in high school!

85
00:10:34,660 --> 00:10:37,660
Mother: Will you take responsibility
for stealing his time?

86
00:10:36,780 --> 00:10:39,910
Jooheon: How did I solve this 15 years ago?

87
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:41,090
Mother: What if the trauma makes his grades drop?

88
00:10:41,580 --> 00:10:45,890
Jooheon: They demanded a ridiculous settlement, 

89
00:10:45,890 --> 00:10:49,000
Jooheon: and I had to get on my knees
and beg for them to lower it.

90
00:10:50,130 --> 00:10:53,540
Jooheon: Back then, I didn't have any money.

91
00:10:54,350 --> 00:10:56,460
Mother: Hello?

92
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:59,960
Mother: When someone's talking to you, you listen!

93
00:11:06,020 --> 00:11:07,960
Jooheon: Oh? I... blocked it.

94
00:11:08,910 --> 00:11:13,460
Jooheon: Enough is enough, ma'am.
Your son started the fight.

95
00:11:13,690 --> 00:11:17,640
Jooheon: And don't you think you're inflating
the settlement way too much?

96
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:20,960
Jooheon: Looks like it's true what they say:
The wealthy are the greediest.

97
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:24,920
Boy: What did you say, you bastard?!
I've had enough of you and your...

98
00:11:22,330 --> 00:11:24,920
Policeman 1: Hey, what do you think
you're doing? Sit down!

99
00:11:27,090 --> 00:11:29,890
Policeman 2: Everybody calm down again, this is not...

100
00:11:29,890 --> 00:11:34,330
Mother: No, my son! Darling, are you all right?!

101
00:11:32,730 --> 00:11:35,710
Jooheon: My body definitely feels lighter.

102
00:11:34,330 --> 00:11:38,820
Mother: Did you see that?
Did you see what he did to my boy?

103
00:11:35,710 --> 00:11:38,820
Jooheon: I haven't caught any
relic-induced illnesses yet either.

104
00:11:38,820 --> 00:11:43,060
Mother: You cannot let him get away with that!
I demand justice!

105
00:11:39,710 --> 00:11:43,060
Jooheon: Are my fighting skills still the same

106
00:11:43,060 --> 00:11:45,290
Jooheon: because I got to keep all of my memories?

107
00:11:43,060 --> 00:11:47,710
Policeman 2: This is a police station!
What do you think you're doing here?

108
00:11:45,290 --> 00:11:47,710
Jooheon: Good. That, at least, works in my favor.

109
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:53,210
Boy: You just made a big mistake, you little...

110
00:11:58,110 --> 00:12:01,930
Mother: Oh my goodness, are you hurt?
My poor baby...

111
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:07,200
Mother: You think this is how
things work here, huh?

112
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:10,180
Mother: Just wait and see.
I'll make you regret this.

113
00:12:10,180 --> 00:12:13,020
Mother: I'm going to call everyone I know and...

114
00:12:11,090 --> 00:12:14,260
Policeman 1: Ma'am, please calm down.

115
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:16,260
Mother: Calm down?
Do I look like I can just calm down?

116
00:12:16,260 --> 00:12:20,800
Mother: You must be dying to get a criminal
record! Don't even dream of a settlement!

117
00:12:19,780 --> 00:12:22,510
Jooheon: A criminal record?
That stuff won't matter.

118
00:12:22,510 --> 00:12:26,600
Jooheon: Once relics appear, the world
will become a lawless wasteland.

119
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:32,180
Jooheon: In 2025, massive earthquakes shook
the entire planet, and tombs appeared.

120
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:36,890
Jooheon: Inside them, relics from myths, legends, 

121
00:12:36,890 --> 00:12:40,500
Jooheon: folktales, and popular fiction were found.

122
00:12:40,500 --> 00:12:44,170
Jooheon: They say stories
remembered for ages possess power.

123
00:12:44,510 --> 00:12:48,510
Jooheon: The humans who came to own these relics
were granted all kinds of abilities.

124
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:52,130
Jooheon: All over the world people
began searching for them.

125
00:12:53,330 --> 00:12:56,840
Jooheon: As luck would have it, I unearthed
the Archaeologist's Relic.

126
00:12:57,290 --> 00:12:59,400
Jooheon: I hit the jackpot.

127
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:03,150
Jooheon: After gaining vast knowledge
of tombs and relics, 

128
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:08,310
Jooheon: I thought I could
finally turn my life around.

129
00:13:09,290 --> 00:13:10,180
Jooheon: But...

130
00:13:13,220 --> 00:13:15,460
Relic hunter 1: What do you mean we can't enter the tomb?

131
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:19,620
Soldier 1: TKBM Corporation holds exclusive
excavation rights to these tombs.

132
00:13:20,260 --> 00:13:22,370
Soldier 1: Everyone, please leave.

133
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:25,000
Relic hunter 2: What? That's ridiculous!

134
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:27,120
Relic hunter 2: Get out of the way, you clown!

135
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:37,870
Soldier 1: If you continue to force
your way in, we will open fire.

136
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:42,800
Jooheon: That's where it all began.

137
00:13:44,460 --> 00:13:47,640
Jooheon: Everything started with
Taejoon Kwon, the chairman of TKBM.

138
00:13:48,310 --> 00:13:50,690
Jooheon: A large number of monopolizers

139
00:13:50,690 --> 00:13:54,730
Jooheon: made it impossible for anyone
but themselves to excavate relics.

140
00:13:57,660 --> 00:14:00,870
Jooheon: Fortunately, 
my excavation ability was recognized, 

141
00:14:00,870 --> 00:14:03,580
Jooheon: and I was scouted by TKBM Corporation.

142
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:03,580
Taejoon: Welcome...

143
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:07,530
Jooheon: I handled all kinds of
dirty jobs for Chairman Kwon.

144
00:14:03,930 --> 00:14:05,040
Taejoon: ...to the team.

145
00:14:08,910 --> 00:14:12,080
Jooheon: Smuggling, theft, spying, 

146
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:14,580
Jooheon: and tomb raiding.

147
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:20,120
Jooheon: I snuck into tombs that the government
had barred off and smuggled relics out.

148
00:14:20,120 --> 00:14:22,910
Jooheon: Chairman Kwon's success skyrocketed.

149
00:14:25,080 --> 00:14:27,220
TKBM Excavator 2: What a scumbag.

150
00:14:27,820 --> 00:14:29,580
TKBM Excavator 1: Seriously.

151
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:34,080
TKBM Excavator 2: A bottom-feeder living off a monopolist.

152
00:14:34,580 --> 00:14:37,110
TKBM Excavator 1: Hey, are you pretending not to hear us?

153
00:14:37,110 --> 00:14:39,580
TKBM Excavator 1: If you were born again, 
would you still live like that?

154
00:14:40,890 --> 00:14:43,460
Jooheon: As if that would ever happen.

155
00:14:44,950 --> 00:14:48,380
Jooheon: I chose to become Chairman Kwon's dog, 

156
00:14:49,110 --> 00:14:53,350
Jooheon: putting up with
every insult and humiliation.

157
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:55,120
Jooheon: And in the end...

158
00:14:56,090 --> 00:14:59,800
Julian: C-Captain, this is a trap!

159
00:15:03,780 --> 00:15:08,200
Jooheon: Once relics appear, the world
will become a lawless wasteland.

160
00:15:09,150 --> 00:15:13,310
Jooheon: It's good that I can still fight, 
but that alone won't be enough.

161
00:15:13,310 --> 00:15:17,660
Jooheon: Time to gather everything
 I need to start excavating...

162
00:15:19,330 --> 00:15:23,330
sign: [TOMB RAIDER JOOHEON SUH]

163
00:15:19,910 --> 00:15:23,330
Jooheon: What's that?
Why are there words floating in the air?

164
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:27,380
Jooheon: Great. I must be losing it.

165
00:15:28,330 --> 00:15:31,330
sign: [TOMB RAIDER JOOHEON SUH]
A LOUSY THIEF WHO CAN'T EVEN USE A SHOVEL.

166
00:15:32,150 --> 00:15:35,930
Jooheon: Only a relic could pull
this kind of crap...

167
00:15:37,330 --> 00:15:40,890
Jooheon: Hey, you feathered rat!
Come out right now!

168
00:15:40,890 --> 00:15:43,730
Jooheon: Are you hiding somewhere and watching me?!

169
00:15:45,580 --> 00:15:49,080
sign: TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS (1/4)
SPY  [RANK F]
DETECT EVERYTHING IN A 1-METER RADIUS.

170
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:49,080
Jooheon: A skill window?

171
00:15:49,310 --> 00:15:51,380
Jooheon: Spy? Rank F?!

172
00:15:51,380 --> 00:15:53,820
Jooheon: That damn crow!

173
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:56,330
Jooheon: Is my life a game now?

174
00:15:56,330 --> 00:15:59,830
sign: NEW QUEST
UNLOCK ALL 4 SKILLS OF A TOMB RAIDER.
AWAKEN THE FOUR HIDDEN SKILLS WITHIN YOU
TO BECOME A FULL-FLEDGED TOMB RAIDER.

175
00:15:57,310 --> 00:15:59,830
Jooheon: What? Activate four skills?

176
00:16:00,420 --> 00:16:03,860
Jooheon: Will you look at that?
Now there's even a quest?

177
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:06,660
Policeman 1: What is it now? Keep it down, will you?

178
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:07,710
Jooheon: Ah... sorry.

179
00:16:11,060 --> 00:16:15,830
Jooheon: Am I... the only one who can see it?
Speaking of which...

180
00:16:18,110 --> 00:16:22,000
Jooheon: Everything within a
one-meter radius is crystal clear.

181
00:16:22,660 --> 00:16:25,420
Jooheon: That's the ability
the Archaeologist's Relic gave me.

182
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:28,750
Jooheon: The relic is gone, 
but the ability remains?

183
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:33,930
Jooheon: Does that mean I can now
see all of my skills this way?

184
00:16:33,930 --> 00:16:37,750
Jooheon: Wait, if this is one out of four, 
that means there's three more.

185
00:16:38,420 --> 00:16:40,660
Jooheon: Well, we're off to a great start.

186
00:16:40,660 --> 00:16:44,890
Jooheon: But what's that crow after?

187
00:16:44,890 --> 00:16:48,530
Jooheon: Relics don't usually help humans...

188
00:16:48,530 --> 00:16:50,750
Geonwoo: Hey, Jooheon!

189
00:16:55,750 --> 00:17:04,170
sign: SERVING AND PROTECTING OUR COMMUNITY

190
00:17:00,350 --> 00:17:04,170
Geonwoo: Bad luck, huh?
That high schooler is a repeat offender.

191
00:17:04,690 --> 00:17:08,200
Geonwoo: He's the one
who should be sitting in that cell.

192
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,670
Geonwoo: Don't worry, I'll take care of everything.

193
00:17:11,310 --> 00:17:13,420
Jooheon: Thanks, Geonwoo.

194
00:17:15,020 --> 00:17:17,170
Geonwoo: Did you hit your head on something?

195
00:17:17,950 --> 00:17:20,670
Geonwoo: Jooheon Suh is thanking me?
What's gotten into you?

196
00:17:21,020 --> 00:17:22,980
Geonwoo: You sound like a totally different person.

197
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:28,000
Geonwoo: Guess the holding cell
really scared you, huh?

198
00:17:30,530 --> 00:17:31,920
Jooheon: Detective Geonwoo Kim.

199
00:17:32,380 --> 00:17:35,910
Jooheon: Growing up at the orphanage, 
he was always there for me like family.

200
00:17:34,350 --> 00:17:35,910
Geonwoo: Come on now. Let's go.

201
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:38,890
Jooheon: He still looked so young 15 years ago.

202
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,750
Jooheon: Geonwoo, have there been
any strange activities lately?

203
00:17:51,730 --> 00:17:55,110
Jooheon: People being possessed
or anything involving superpowers?

204
00:17:55,110 --> 00:17:58,500
Geonwoo: What are you talking about?
Are you sure you're all right?

205
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:02,000
Jooheon: You need to see a shaman
for these kinds of things.

206
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:06,250
Geonwoo: Well, sometimes it does feel
like my wife has superpowers.

207
00:18:06,250 --> 00:18:10,250
Geonwoo: How does she always find my secret stash?

208
00:18:11,490 --> 00:18:14,750
Jooheon: Looks like relic users
haven't appeared yet.

209
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:18,500
Geonwoo: Go home and get some rest.
You had a rough day.

210
00:18:19,890 --> 00:18:24,150
Jooheon: Tombs should have appeared here and there, 
but no relic users as of now.

211
00:18:24,150 --> 00:18:26,750
Jooheon: This is the perfect time to make a move.

212
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:31,020
Jooheon: The problem is money.

213
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:34,330
Jooheon: Most of the early relics
were in Europe and the Americas.

214
00:18:34,330 --> 00:18:35,690
Jooheon: But I need plane tickets...

215
00:18:35,690 --> 00:18:37,750
Kyungtae: Hey, Jooheon Suh.

216
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:44,750
Kyungtae: Why the hell are you
wandering around instead of working?

217
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:49,500
Jooheon: There's my cash cow.

218
00:18:51,690 --> 00:18:53,020
Jooheon: Kyeongtae Park.

219
00:18:54,290 --> 00:18:58,110
Jooheon: A local thug who runs a small gallery
with his older sister, Kyungjoo Park.

220
00:18:59,310 --> 00:19:03,020
Jooheon: Back in school, I was desperate for money, 
so I worked part-time for them.

221
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:07,600
Jooheon: For a pathetic wage, I put up
with their punches and worked like a dog.

222
00:19:10,200 --> 00:19:13,080
Seungwoo: Why aren't you answering, 
you little shit?!

223
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:16,960
Seungwoo: Do you need a beating to come to
your senses? Lower your damn eyes, you...

224
00:19:28,490 --> 00:19:31,830
Jooheon: You morons go and
tell your boss that I'm done.

225
00:19:32,690 --> 00:19:37,830
Jooheon: So hand over
my back pay and severance.

226
00:19:41,860 --> 00:19:44,750
Kyungtae: All right, you bastard.
Let's settle this today!

227
00:19:58,750 --> 00:20:00,460
Thug 1: B-Boss!

228
00:20:00,780 --> 00:20:04,960
Thug 2: What's with this guy?
Y-You go and help him!

229
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:07,670
Thug 1: Shut up! Rush at him all at once!

230
00:20:24,690 --> 00:20:27,460
Thug 2: My eyes... My nose...

231
00:20:27,730 --> 00:20:30,460
Thug 2: My eyes! My eyes!

232
00:20:30,890 --> 00:20:33,910
Thug 2: My nose! My nose!

233
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:38,370
Seungwoo: W-What's going on? How is this possible?

234
00:20:38,370 --> 00:20:42,600
Jooheon: Well, that's 15 years
of accumulated skills for you.

235
00:20:45,290 --> 00:20:47,040
Jooheon: I'm missing the strength, though.

236
00:20:47,750 --> 00:20:49,840
Jooheon: I need to finish this quickly.

237
00:20:50,930 --> 00:20:53,380
Jooheon: Is that all? Finished already?

238
00:20:54,540 --> 00:20:57,600
Kyungtae: You ungrateful brat!
This is how you repay our kindness?!

239
00:20:57,600 --> 00:21:00,790
Seungwoo: B-Boss, be careful with that knife!

240
00:21:01,310 --> 00:21:04,460
Seungwoo: What if he gets seriously hurt and...

241
00:21:03,130 --> 00:21:05,290
Kyungtae: Will you shut up?! Who cares?!

242
00:21:05,980 --> 00:21:08,290
Jooheon: Oh? This knife... is a relic.

243
00:21:08,890 --> 00:21:11,240
Jooheon: Why does that lowlife have it?

244
00:21:12,490 --> 00:21:15,620
Jooheon: Well, I guess it's not all that surprising.

245
00:21:15,620 --> 00:21:20,660
Jooheon: Some relics slip out of
their tombs and hide in human society.

246
00:21:21,290 --> 00:21:25,910
Kyungtae: You think you're tough? Die, you bastard!

247
00:21:26,640 --> 00:21:29,950
Jooheon: Either way, that thing is mine now.
